('flp:ln-fl-001', 'ln-fl-001', 'w-mnt-01', 'flc-2025', 'Humaid Al Ketbi', 'حميد الكتبي', array['flm-safety','flm-regulation','flm-project','flm-stakeholder','flm-knowledge','flm-future']::text[], 'Keeping senior control-room knowledge when experienced operators retire', 'How should succession and knowledge capture be paced so that retirements never thin a crew below its proven experience?', 'This paper looks at "Keeping senior control-room knowledge when experienced operators retire". It reviews current practice in our area, compares it with published international guidance and proposes three options with their risks, costs and the people they affect.', 'Shift Manager (role card)', 'accepted', '2025-06-01', 'p-training-mgr', null, '2025-06-20', 'completed', '2025-06-30', '[{"at":"2025-06-20T10:00:00Z","status":"project:accepted","by":"p-training-mgr","note":null}]'::jsonb, '2025-06-30T16:00:00Z'),
